menu "Wendy BLE exports"
    config WENDY_BLE_EXPORT
        bool "Enable BLE host functions for WASM guests"
        default y
        depends on WENDY_BLE
        help
            BLE GAP and GATT functions exposed to WASM guests, using NimBLE.

            The NimBLE stack itself is owned and started by the wendy_ble
            component (the WendyCom BLE transport), which this depends on.
endmenu
